WEBVTT

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.000
Hana!

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.380
Can I come in?

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.090
Something came from Hazuki.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.800
Maybe it's a new outfit!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.560
Huh? Shion, where's the package?

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:21.390
This envelope is all there was, Hana.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.060
To Hana

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.640
An envelope?

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.440
H-Hana?

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:31.700
Maybe...

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.820
Maybe they don't want me anymore?

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:41.080
No, we're not abandoning you, Hana.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.080
But you're a high school student now,

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.840
so I thought you'd want to start
picking out your own clothes.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.050
It's all so sudden, though.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.340
Picking out my own...

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:54.220
<i>There are clothes
that you like, right, Hana?</i>

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.010
Yes, but...

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.720
it's not like I'm dissatisfied
with the clothes you always buy for me.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:03.390
<i>Send me a photo later
of the outfit you picked!</i>

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:04.940
Wh-What?

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.650
<i>I'm looking forward to it! Bye!</i>

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:11.740
H-Hey...

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.820
Are you sure it's okay,
leaving that to Hana?

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.450
What if she starts dressing
like a punk girl?

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:18.990
Not gonna happen.

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:20.740
We're talking Hana.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:24.000
Although I can see her getting clothes
that are even plainer than now.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:25.920
That could be.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:31.710
But the outfits you always choose
for Hana suit her well.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.590
R-Really?

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:35.300
Did they really suit her that well?

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.850
Yeah. Who knows a girl
better than her mother?

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.520
Y-You may have a point there!

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.060
You look really happy.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.260
I got Kamuri!

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:44.050
Kamuri is finally in my arms,
just like I dreamed about!

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.260
I'm never letting you go! I love you!

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.520
It's not going to be that easy!

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.440
Look what I've got, Kamuri!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.360
Candy!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.070
So that's where Kamu got the sweets.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.580
I caught one!

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.370
You won't catch me next time.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.040
STARTING SLOW

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:12.960
Next time, I'll research your favorite treats
to use as the perfect bait!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.920
That's what you say...

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.750
...but it won't be that cheap!

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.170
Like fishing with dynamite!

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:20.670
Good morning!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.550
Hana, good morning!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.050
Good morning, Hana!

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:26.680
Good morning, Hana.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:30.480
Anyway, though we're here during summer
break, it's great there aren't any classes!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.190
Wouldn't it be cool if we gathered here,
chatted and then went home?

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.060
Then it's just a meeting place.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:37.690
Without lunch even.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:39.940
We finish here in the morning.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.400
Wanna get lunch somewhere?

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.900
Good idea!

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:44.320
Hana?

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.450
Oh, sorry.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.410
What's wrong, Hana?

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:51.120
Are you hungry, too?

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:58.040
Is it strange to wear clothes my mom's
picked out, even though I'm in high school?

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.210
So your mother's selected
all your clothes?

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:02.340
Yeah.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.550
But now she wants me to choose my own.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:09.180
Once in a while,
my mom makes me an outfit.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:10.680
Really?

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:14.890
I wear kimonos
that one of my grandmas patches up.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.730
And your mom chooses your
outfits, doesn't she, Kamu?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:22.610
Yep. But they're always
frilly, frilly, frilly, frilly, frilly.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.200
I can see how you'd want to lose
a frill here and there.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:29.490
Well, I choose my own clothes,

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.200
but I don't think
your mom choosing is weird.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.120
O-Oh...

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.170
This is a good opportunity.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.130
Why don't we all go clothes shopping?

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.000
I wanted to buy a new outfit anyway.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:44.590
Great idea! Let's all choose an outfit
that would suit Hana!

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.760
I think you should go
with something more radical!

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:49.680
Like fully nude.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.640
Then she wouldn't need any clothes.

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:54.810
Choosing by myself would be difficult.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.400
I think I understand how Hiroe feels.

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:01.360
Hana, how's Big Sis Hannen doing anyway?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.530
Good!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.280
I guess she went to that festival with Shion.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.660
Really? I wish we would've run into them.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.120
If she can go to a festival,
then convenience stores must be easy!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:15.870
She's gone to convenience stores
as far as ten kilometers away!

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.670
Is there a point to expanding
her territory like that?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.500
Then why don't we expand our territory, too?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.300
For Hana, a map of clothing stores
that would suit her!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.510
Yeah.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.340
Well, would tomorrow be good?

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.260
That's our Eiko, always quick to act!

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:31.890
I'm free tomorrow.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.720
How about you, Hana?

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:34.810
Y-Yeah!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.980
Tomorrow's good. Thank you!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:42.110
All right! Let's find a Hana-like outfit
that'd look good on Hana!

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.610
An outfit like me?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.900
After that, let's have a parfait.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:50.030
That's great! The "Hana outfit-picking"
followed by parfait course!

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:50.870
Outfit-parfait!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.080
Outfit-parfait.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:55.040
That also means the perfect outfit!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.040
Outfit-perfect.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.080
Outfit-perfect.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.330
You guys are always
overflowing with energy.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.420
Good morning, Teacher!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.550
Good morning!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.300
Let's all do our best
with plenty of energy!

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.590
I'll leave that to you guys.

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.340
You can count on me!

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:13.220
Well, let's get started with homeroom.

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:22.480
Good job, Teacher.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:23.480
Thanks.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.440
You're done for the day, aren't you?

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:27.240
Yeah.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:31.320
Jeez. Why do we have to come to school
during summer vacation?

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.450
Want a piece of candy?

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.330
It's good.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.790
I know. That is good.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.040
Then here you go.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.670
Thank you.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.460
Ms. Enami...

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.550
Please come over here immediately.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.340
- Are you in for a lecture?
- Shut up.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.600
Here, hold on to this.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.220
Yes, what is it?

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.150
Hold on to it...

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:06.480
Then, in other words...

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.190
It's sweet.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:13.780
I'm beat.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:15.240
Good job.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.450
Where's the candy?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.910
It's long gone.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.410
What?

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.920
You took a long time coming back.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.920
That's not my fault.
The head teacher's lectures run long.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:31.010
So it was a lecture!

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.010
Oh, shut up.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:35.100
You don't have any more candy?

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.350
No, that was my last one.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:41.230
Seriously? Crap.

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:43.480
I can...

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:45.980
still taste it, though.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.610
What are you saying, idiot?

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:48.940
That hurt!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.400
I didn't whap you that hard.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:54.240
Okay, it didn't really hurt at all.

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:56.120
Go on home now.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:06.880
<i>It's sweet.</i>

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.300
<i>But...</i>

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.510
<i>it's different from the sweetness
I was hoping for.</i>

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.260
<i>Kidding.</i>

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:17.010
She actually had one more!

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:18.760
She had a lot.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.770
She gave me one before.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:26.480
Eiko, Eiko, Eiko, Eiko, Eiko, Eiko...

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.030
Oh, Hana, welcome back!

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:36.910
Welcome home, Hana!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.160
Wh-What's with your outfits?

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.040
You wanna know, Hana?

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.250
We wanted to tell you so badly
that we've been waiting here for you.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:50.750
Actually, the summer course I registered for
the other day starts tomorrow!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:55.380
I followed the landlady's advice to keep
the students from noticing I'm a year behind

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:59.100
by attending in a high school uniform,
so now I'm just trying it on!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.060
W-Wow!

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.730
You look cute, Ms. Hannen.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:08.020
Hiroe, I can understand, but why do you
have a school uniform on, Shion?

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.150
On a whim!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.270
Huh, a whim?

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:11.610
On a whim?

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:16.240
W-Well, anyway, what do you think
about this plan, Hana?

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.570
Um... It's summer vacation,

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:22.580
so there probably won't be any students
wearing their school uniforms there.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.000
To Hana

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.470
What kind of clothes are "me-like"?

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:44.970
Where am I?

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:47.310
Huh? Why am I wearing pajamas?

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.980
Hana, are you joining
the summer course, too?

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:53.440
I'm...

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:56.990
Hiroe, you're back in your sweats!

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:59.530
I was pursuing "me-ness,"
and this is what I found!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.070
You and me both, Hana!

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.830
You're right! Now I'm wearing sweats!

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.460
Uh-oh! I'm gonna be late for the course!

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:08.830
Later, Hana!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.750
H-Hiroe!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.840
B-Be careful!

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:18.880
What's that?

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:20.970
A spring?

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:28.940
Shion?

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.690
Did you lose this gold Tama?

00:11:34.070 --> 00:11:36.320
Or this silver Tama?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.700
Shion, wh-what's this about?

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:40.910
Now I'm the fairy of the spring.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.820
I finally got a job.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.580
Which Tama did you throw in here?

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:50.080
I didn't throw either in there!

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.170
Since you're so honest,

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.710
I'll give you this gold Tama.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:57.800
If you take silver, you'll have three.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.050
Th-Thank you.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:04.470
In exchange for saving me,
I'll tell you a secret!

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.930
Hana, actually I had a gap year!

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.480
Me, too.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:11.810
Kamuri, you, too?

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:15.520
I had so many gap years that I'm 20 now.

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:18.280
<i>No wonder she seems so mature.</i>

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:22.450
A-Actually I had a gap year, too.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.330
Oh! You, too, Hana?

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:30.330
Oh, jeez! So we were all
in the same boat, huh?

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:32.120
That's a relief!

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.430
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.180
Especially Eiko...

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:48.930
For believing you were 20. Shoot.

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:55.560
Hana, Hana! Over here!

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.320
R-Right.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.490
I just don't know what to buy.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.950
You don't have to buy something today.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:06.450
Let's take our time
and look for an outfit that suits you.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.120
O-Okay.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:09.950
The raw material is good.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:13.830
I think everything
would look good on you, Hana.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:18.460
That's right! Like Kamu,
you're excellent raw material!

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:20.840
Raw material...

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:24.180
The tuna slicing show is about to begin!

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:27.010
Come one, come all to see it!

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.850
Did you hear that, Kamu?

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.810
We definitely have to take part!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:32.140
Roger Wilco!

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.390
And so, excuse us!

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:35.560
Bye!

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:38.110
Tama! Kamuri!

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.440
We'll start without you!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.820
For now, let's just you and me
go to the shops, Hana.

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:45.990
Okay.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:52.750
<i>The outfits Mom chooses are cute,</i>

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.120
<i>but sometimes I think
they're a little childish.</i>

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:59.210
<i>But then, when I think
I should wear something more mature,</i>

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:02.630
<i>I somehow get the feeling
that it doesn't suit me yet.</i>

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:04.510
Maybe you should just take your time.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:08.850
I think you should wear
what you honestly like to wear.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.890
It wouldn't be Hana-like to force yourself
to wear clothes that are different.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.900
Even though that's cute in its own way.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:18.730
Eiko...

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:23.860
I think I like this.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.150
That is Hana-like.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.660
Me-like...

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:32.410
Yeah, clothes that are really honest and cute.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.790
So try it on!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:35.870
Already?

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.460
Excuse me!

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:39.420
She wants to try on an outfit.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:40.290
Eiko!

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.640
<i>Eiko is amazing.</i>

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.810
<i>She gets things done quickly
but in a calm way.</i>

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:57.440
<i>She's able to find outfits
that look good on her.</i>

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.940
<i>Maybe she really is 20?</i>

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:04.320
I wonder if this does look good on me.

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:10.240
It feels like it makes me look
just a little more mature.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.280
Well?

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:13.160
Eiko!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.080
Nice! That looks really good on you!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.960
Wh-What's wrong?

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.960
I was thinking you look
a little more mature in that.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.300
S-Stop! Please, stop!

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:27.920
Please, it isn't necessary
to give me any compliments!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.470
Why are you suddenly so polite?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:33.970
I don't know if I look more mature,
but I might've grown a bit.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.100
Like your chest?

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:37.600
Yeah.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:41.060
Actually, my bra doesn't fit anymore.

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.940
Want me to go with you for that, too?

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.690
W-Would you?

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.740
If you'd like, sure.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:47.860
Thank goodness!

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:51.570
I was going to ask Shion
to come with me, but...

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:52.990
<i>Boom!</i>

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:59.580
Bigger or not, my chest
is like an ant to Shion's mountains.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:03.710
Compared to Shion, we may all be ants.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:06.590
What do you want to do?
Leave after we buy your clothes?

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:11.590
Um, if possible, I'd like just the two of us
to go bra-shopping.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.090
Really?

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:18.850
I don't think Tama or Kamu would tease you.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:20.980
Yeah.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.770
I know, but...

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:27.360
Kamu?

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:32.860
TUNA

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:32.860
SUSHI

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.400
The slicing show was awesome!

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.860
I enjoyed watching and sampling.

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:36.330
You two are really enchanted with tuna.

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:38.830
The age of tuna is coming!

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.170
Hana, that outfit looks really good on you!

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:46.380
It's cute! Pitting that against this t-shirt
would be a good contest!

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.340
A good contest against the brilliance of tuna.

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.970
I don't understand,
but that's a compliment?

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:53.640
I don't understand, but it's high praise.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:59.350
It's fun here with all the one-of-a-kind items!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:04.690
This is where we bought the presents
for Hana and Tama last time.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:11.440
MR. BEAR

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.110
Oh yeah!

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:11.440
Come to think of it, aren't we between
Eiko and Kamu's birthdays right now?

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.070
That's right.

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:17.530
Then why don't we buy teddy bears
for Eiko and Kamuri, too?

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.910
Okay, then you buy for Eiko, Hana!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.620
I'll buy for Kamu!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:26.290
Nice idea! Then we'll all have one.

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.960
A sense of unity is important.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.470
The Four Musketeers burst onto the scene!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:38.720
What colors would you like,
Eiko and Kamuri?

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:40.970
Go on, you two, pick!

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.350
Go ahead!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.850
Okay, you twisted my arm.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.980
Maybe I'll go with this one.

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.610
This one's calling out to me.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:50.860
Roger!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:55.570
So would you put these
together with yours and Tama's?

00:17:56.870 --> 00:18:00.040
Eiko and I want to be with Hana and Tama.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.040
What a good girl!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:06.370
You did a great job raising her
all by yourself, Eiko!

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.880
Tama, I think your
Kamu-capturing technique is improving.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.590
So Hana, would you keep them for us?

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:14.970
Of course!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:17.090
Then we'll always be together!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.090
Tama!

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:19.220
Hana!

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.220
Tama!

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:21.100
Parfait!

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:22.100
Parfait!

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:23.770
That's right, a parfait!

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:26.520
A whimsical bear and tuna parfait!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.520
I'll pass on the tuna.

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.070
I want a regular parfait.

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.570
Thank you for today!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.280
I was able to choose a nice outfit
because of you guys!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.160
Wear it the next time we go out!

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:44.160
Sure!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:48.170
I wanna have a parfait, and go out
for sushi and pork cutlet on rice,

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:50.210
all with you wearing that outfit.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:53.170
I'm not sure whether her outfit
was your main point.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:55.550
Well, Hana, see you in school!

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.430
See you, Hana.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:18:58.340
See ya.

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:03.350
SUMMER COURSE

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:08.350
<i>I think I'll skip today
and just start from tomorrow.</i>

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:09.900
<i>No.</i>

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:13.110
<i>I have a feeling it'll rain tomorrow,
so I'll go the day after tomorrow.</i>

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.070
SAWAIZAWA
PREP SCHOOL

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:18.950
<i>I-I have a feeling
this is an unlucky day for me.</i>

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.460
SUMMER COURSE GUIDE

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:40.050
Fish was on sale today,
so I tried making sashimi.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:42.800
It looks delicious! I'm hungry!

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.060
Also, this looked good,

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.480
so I tried making simmered fish head.

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.560
Simmered fish head looked good?

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:51.810
SUSHI

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:54.070
There's a lot of DHA in the eyeball.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:55.280
Shion!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:57.280
What's wrong?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.450
I have a favor to ask for after dinner.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.410
You want to take another bath together
so I can wash your hair?

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:05.660
N-Nothing like that!

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.710
I used the money Mom gave me
to buy an outfit,

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.040
but if you don't mind,
could you take a photo of me wearing it?

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:16.130
I want to send it to my parents!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:19.300
Sure. Let's show it to Hazuki!

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:22.180
We'll need to prepare a set and props, too!

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:24.680
We don't need that!

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:27.680
Shion...

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:30.140
Ta-da!

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:32.430
Shion?

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:35.060
Let's take a photo together!

00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:38.360
That outfit is really cute.

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:40.070
Y-You think so?

00:22:40.610 --> 00:22:42.070
It suits you, Hana.

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:44.280
Thank you, Shion!

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:48.030
I wonder if she'll be surprised
to suddenly get a photo.

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:49.530
I'm sure she'll be pleased!

00:22:49.780 --> 00:22:52.540
I hope Hazuki sends back
a photo of herself in a school uniform!

00:22:52.540 --> 00:22:55.580
I think Dad would put his foot down.

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:58.080
Okay, Hana, let's stand next to each other.

00:22:58.330 --> 00:22:59.040
Right!

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:04.510
Hana, recently, you seem
like a high school student.

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:08.590
You have to look straight ahead.

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:11.760
After all, you made
that strange remark, Shion!

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:15.430
Oh, let's send her a photo of you
in the shark pajamas, too!

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:18.520
Shion! No way!

00:23:20.980 --> 00:23:23.320
<i>Hana Ichinose. 17 years old.</i>

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:27.240
<i>I haven't been able to share my secret
with my friends yet,</i>

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:31.120
<i>but I hope I'll be able to tell them someday.</i>

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:33.990
<i>It's been a roundabout way,</i>

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:38.210
<i>but my happiness has slowly started!</i>
